{"id":"W27441759faca108dba8fdb87","zh":"车体加速度","en":"","name":"车体加速度","language":"zh","domain":"动力响应","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":"车辆车体的加速度响应。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"保留测点、方向及统计口径；不能与轮对、转向架或钢轨加速度互换。car body 不省略成 car。","usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W27441759faca108dba8fdb87","text":"车体加速度","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S0bfc16f670c1bddffed0","source_id":"P115","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"计算结果表明: 以2种模型生成的轨道随机不平顺为激振源,获得的车辆-轨道系统动力响应分布熵差异小于2%, 2种模型均能准确表达不平顺激扰特性;为保证模拟与实测不平顺的概率密度分布一致,采用随机模型和概率模型分别需要生成131和33个随机样本,概率模型具有更高的分析效率;在给定计算工况下,轮轨力和车体加速度的幅值分别为38~152kN和-0.042g~0.043g(g为重力加速度), 均未超过《高速铁路设计规范》(TB 10621—2014)中的限值(轮轨力为170kN,车体加速度为 0.25g),表明此高速铁路轨道不平顺状态较优,行车安全性和舒适性可以得到保证。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sb57bb55912ee15700f16","source_id":"P115","page":6,"page_end":7,"language":"zh","text":"显然,对于车辆系统的垂向动力响应指标(轮轨垂向力和车体垂向加速度),概率熵差异在2%以内,表明TISM和TIPM的结果吻合良好;此外,轮轨力和车体加速度的幅值分别为38~152kN和 -0.042g~0.043g,均未超过《高速铁路设计规范》 (TB 10621—2014)中的限值(轮轨力为170kN,车体加速度为0.25g),说明此轨道不平顺状态较好, 行车安全,舒适性可以得到保证。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":6,"page_end":7}]}],"sources":{"P054":{"id":"P054","title":"Influence of temperature gradient of slab track on the dynamic responses of the train-CRTS III slab track on subgrade nonlinear coupled system","authors":"Q Xu, S Sun, Y Xu, C Hu, W Chen, L Xu","year":"2022","doi":"10.1038/s41598-022-18898-y","journal_citation":"Scientific Reports 12 (1), 14638","label":"Xu等（2022）","overview_slug":"2022-influence-of-temperature-gradient-of-slab-track-on-the-dynamic-responses-of-the-train-crts-iii-slab"},"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W8741b998d5a80cb982732e02","name":"car body accelerations","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"W9dc91cc50f91bcb348bca190","name":"car body acceleration","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W8741b998d5a80cb982732e02","name":"car body accelerations","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"W9dc91cc50f91bcb348bca190","name":"car body acceleration","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W8741b998d5a80cb982732e02","name":"car body accelerations","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"W9dc91cc50f91bcb348bca190","name":"car body acceleration","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"},{"id":"P054","title":"Influence of temperature gradient of slab track on the dynamic responses of the train-CRTS III slab track on subgrade nonlinear coupled system","authors":"Q Xu, S Sun, Y Xu, C Hu, W Chen, L Xu","year":"2022","doi":"10.1038/s41598-022-18898-y","journal_citation":"Scientific Reports 12 (1), 14638","label":"Xu等（2022）","overview_slug":"2022-influence-of-temperature-gradient-of-slab-track-on-the-dynamic-responses-of-the-train-crts-iii-slab"}]}